@startuml
title Relational Access V1 - L2 ShardingSphere-Proxy
autonumber

participant "Component Repository" as Repo
participant "MyBatisAccessResolver" as Resolver
participant "SpringMyBatisAccess" as Access
participant "Ordinary JDBC DataSource" as DS
participant "ShardingSphere-Proxy" as Proxy
database "Physical shards" as DB

Repo -> Resolver : resolve("orders-proxy")
Resolver --> Repo : Proxy-facing Access
Repo -> Access : execute*(Mapper, logical_table)
Access -> DS : logical SQL
DS -> Proxy : JDBC protocol
Proxy -> Proxy : parse / route / rewrite
Proxy -> DB : physical SQL
DB --> Repo : result

note over DS,Proxy
The application DataSource is a normal pool whose JDBC URL points to Proxy.
There is no ShardingSphereDataSource in the application process.
end note
@enduml
